{"nodes": [{"type": "file", "id": "a31566819c8d4e98", "x": -175, "y": -188, "width": 350, "height": 375, "color": "#f5c2e7", "file": ".trash/mange manger manger/Photosynthese.md", "subpath": null}, {"type": "file", "id": "d524fc5a645141dd", "x": 350, "y": -172, "width": 200, "height": 150, "color": null, "file": "images/Calvin-cycle4.svg", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "cbc56da6891e409e", "x": 310, "y": -12, "width": 280, "height": 185, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "**Cycle de Calvin**\n\nLe cycle de Calvin (aussi connu comme le cycle de Calvin-Benson-Bassham) est une s\u00e9rie de r\u00e9actions biochimiques  des organismes photosynth\u00e9tiques ayant lieu dans le stroma des chloroplastes chez les ..."}, {"type": "text", "id": "0262d7cdcb494f60", "x": 0, "y": 372, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#a6e3a1", "text": "**light-dependent reactions**\n\nchemical reactions involved in photosynthesis induced by light"}, {"type": "text", "id": "5d65c29173184759", "x": -504, "y": 209, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#89dceb", "text": "**photosynthesis, dark reaction**\n\ncomplex cycle of enzyme-mediated reactions which catalyzes the reduction of carbon dioxide to sugar"}, {"type": "text", "id": "b45792d5072e4c58", "x": -504, "y": -319, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#fab387", "text": "**m\u00e9tabolisme cellulaire**\n\nthe chemical reactions and pathways by which individual cells transform chemical substances"}, {"type": "text", "id": "126d3c26a699423f", "x": 0, "y": -495, "width": 280, "height": 135, "color": "#f9e2af", "text": "**processus biologique**\n\ntransformation se d\u00e9roulant dans un organisme vivant ou entre plusieurs organismes en interaction, mettant en jeux habituellement des r\u00e9actions chimiques ou d'autres natures"}], "edges": [{"id": "dacd980c69bc4993", "fromNode": "a31566819c8d4e98", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "cbc56da6891e409e", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "comprend"}, {"id": "ec782f7f832d49c5", "fromNode": "a31566819c8d4e98", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "0262d7cdcb494f60", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "comprend"}, {"id": "9a8743aaa84e48f7", "fromNode": "a31566819c8d4e98", "fromSide": "left", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "5d65c29173184759", "toSide": "right", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "comprend"}, {"id": "f414db3e8ea24668", "fromNode": "a31566819c8d4e98", "fromSide": "left", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "b45792d5072e4c58", "toSide": "right", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "est un type de"}, {"id": "05972617ae8c42c7", "fromNode": "a31566819c8d4e98", "fromSide": "top", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "126d3c26a699423f", "toSide": "bottom", "toEnd": null, "color": null, "label": "est un(e)"}]}